  "notes": [
    "entry.id is sha256(raw jsonl line)[:24] for JSONL readers, the message id for opencode, the sqlite rowid for hermes; duplicate identical lines gain a '-N' suffix",
    "claude continuation-segment entries carry namespaced:true with the raw suffix; the wire id is sha256(sessionID+\"\\x00\"+fileRevision)[:12]+\"-\"+id, and fileRevision is inode-dependent",
    "next_cursor is the first entry id of the page (the 'before' argument that returns the next-older page); namespaced cursors are flagged",
    "steps with append_jsonl_lines/append_sql_statements model live tail: content is appended before the step's read",
    "total is the full visible entry count; truncated marks clamped payloads; source_corrupt marks skipped corrupt rows"
  ],
